@startuml
title Activity 12 - Supplier Creates and Submits Delivery

|Supplier|
start
:Open pending delivery;
:Review PO and acknowledged items;
:Enter dispatch date and quantities;
:Enter carrier or tracking details;
:Attach delivery document if available;
|Frontend|
:Validate quantities and required dates;
if (Delivery data valid?) then (yes)
  :POST delivery record;
  |Backend|
  :Verify supplier and PO ownership;
  :Check delivery is not already completed;
  if (Accepted?) then (yes)
    :Set delivery status = SUBMITTED;
    :Persist delivery;
    :Create GRN task for requester;
    :Notify requester in-app and email;
    |Supplier|
    :See delivery submitted;
    stop
  else (no)
    :Return conflict or authorization error;
    |Frontend|
    :Show submission error;
    stop
  endif
else (no)
  :Show delivery validation errors;
  stop
endif
@enduml
